      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不用，就这样就行了――啊ー。\n大叔真快啊。真希望你能代替我参加比赛啊ー。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a9ceb4ac7c5cf35a1937ad22f105ca163b8c3e5bbdab4891b5815446ff42a2a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
